OL,3,GNEWSALack of coaches and track damage
OL,4,Aleave athletics club struggling
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren across the country may have
OL,7,Fbeen inspired, by recent European
OL,8,FAthletics Championships and the feats
OL,9,Fof athletes like British sprinters Amy
OL,10,FHunt and Matthew Hudson-Smith, to take
OL,11,Fup the sport.
OL,13,FBut is the sport ready for them? One
OL,14,Fclub not far from the venue which
OL,15,Fhosted the championships said they were
OL,16,Fstruggling to cope with the interest.
OL,18,FA summer camp run by the Wolverhampton
OL,19,Fand Bilston Athletics Club was
OL,20,Fwell-attended which their chairman,
OL,21,FColin Thompson, said "was inspired by"
OL,22,Fthe Birmingham event.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
