OL,3,GNEWSALack of coaches and track damage
OL,4,Aleave athletics club struggling
OL,5,
OL,6,F"That helps us, but what happens is
OL,7,Fpeople come down, having been inspired
OL,8,Fby the sport, only to find that we
OL,9,Fcan't accommodate them through lack of
OL,10,Fcoaches," he added.
